# PR reviewers

When creating or updating a GitHub pull request:

- Follow `.cursor/skills/create-pr/SKILL.md` for the French description template.
- Assign the PR author.
- Request reviewers as the other two of `fruitizz`, `Angelo-Cosme`, and `noukpoherve` (from the PR or ticket assignee). Skip a login if it is the author.
- Automation lives in `.github/workflows/pr-assignment.yml`; still set `--assignee` / `--reviewer` on `gh pr create`.
- Never add Co-authored-by or tooling attribution.
